{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"d970ebf8bc823582de252c413e8b838ba01b07f765f225f359b35765b7ee5400","digest":{"component_or_area":"test framework / AST-based guards","key_entities":["tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/apply/test_applier_repair_property.py","tests/unit/test_llm_timeouts.py","tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/fetch/test_probe_capability_heldout.py","tests/unit/test_usage_log_pricing_qualified_2ca9.py","tests/unit/test_bedrock_provider.py","tests/unit/test_code_review_assemble.py","tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_cloud_rate_limit_sweep_heldout.py","tests/unit/test_container_roster.py","rebar_reconciler/applier.py","apply_inbound.py","rebar/llm/runner.py","llm/structured_run.py","llm/agent_call.py","inbound_probe.py","adapters/jira/probe.py","llm/usage_log.py","config.split_provider_qualifier","llm/capabilities.py","llm/code_review/assemble.py","adapters/jira/backend.py","plan_review/passes.py","test_acli_graph_pagination_heldout.py","test_web_tool_gating.py"],"problem_keywords":["vacuous guards","AST scanning","hardcoded file paths","module refactoring","structural tests"],"propositions":["Single-file AST guards fail silently when the policed construct moves to a sibling module after refactoring because they pin scan targets to hardcoded filenames instead of deriving population from imports.","Four confirmed vacuous guards (F1-F4) scan files with zero instances of their target constructs: applier.py for invariants imports, runner.py for timeout code, inbound_probe.py for rebar imports, usage_log.py for colon-split string methods.","Vacuous guards are undetectable without anti-vacuity assertions proving the scan population is non-empty and contains the actual construct definition, as demonstrated by survivors with explicit landmark coverage checks.","Repair pattern: widen scan target from single file to transitive closure of intra-package imports, replace line-prefix matching with AST import analysis, add landmark assertions naming the expected construct locations, and verify with mutation tests that re-introduce the construct at its real home."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787688915246304001,"uuid":"3f4cc8f2-21f8-4616-a225-e2514547c63a"}